\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Experimental measurement for the intensity of the laser while it is warming up. There are two plots, one where there is no polariser and one where the polarisation is changed by 10$^\circ $ every 10 seconds for 9 minutes. In the plot without polarisation, we observe a slowly drifting oscillating wave. In the plot with polarisation, there is a modulated wave.}}{3}{figure.caption.12}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:warmup}{{4}{3}{Experimental measurement for the intensity of the laser while it is warming up. There are two plots, one where there is no polariser and one where the polarisation is changed by 10$^\circ $ every 10 seconds for 9 minutes. In the plot without polarisation, we observe a slowly drifting oscillating wave. In the plot with polarisation, there is a modulated wave}{figure.caption.12}{}}
